ArcticInference
The native suffix code derives from Snowflake ArcticInference, licensed under
Apache-2.0, at commit aca5d9a8a62474035c15d114d40a01abc8c94b51.
The derived files are:
- native/bindings.cc
- native/suffix_tree.cc
- native/suffix_tree.h
- native/int32_map.h
- native/CMakeLists.txt
- native/suffix_native/cache.py

The original copyright notices and native/LICENSE are retained.
The Python wrapper changes the import namespace and fixes the default proposal
limit attribute. native/suffix_native/__init__.py is empty.

SGLang
patches/sglang-suffix.patch modifies SGLang v0.5.21, licensed under Apache-2.0,
at commit e00930c5489053f26d86b179cee0d087f846acbb.
The full upstream checkout is separate and excluded from this repository.

Spec-Bench
configs/specbench-subset.jsonl contains selected question records from
data/spec_bench/question.jsonl at Spec-Bench commit
fd2c1cd7d2201ef71db4c5f4e455008f017967bf.
The repository's Apache-2.0 license is retained in configs/SPECBENCH_LICENSE.
The dataset categories and questions may have additional source provenance.
configs/source-lock.json records the source file hash and the deterministic
selection rule.

Model and paper
The GPU runner downloads Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct separately from Hugging Face
at revision a09a35458c702b33eeacc393d103063234e8bc28.
This repository does not redistribute model weights.
The paper, arXiv:2411.04975v3, is cited but is not redistributed.
